WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.583
Five minutes, Melo

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:08.833
Understood

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:14.167
Ser Oakley

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.100
Carmelo...

00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:19.875
seems you’re my last friend in Knicks colors

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.375
Quite the opposite, actually

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:22.958
The whole city cheers your name 

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.583
outside these Garden walls

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.083
I saw what they did to you

00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:29.333
More like what I did to them

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:30.625
It’s not right

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.000
You’re a legend

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:34.500
I’m just an old enforcer

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:37.292
When I saw how the front office was treating you... 

00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:38.292
well...

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:39.625
I did what I’ve always done...

00:00:40.042 --> 00:00:42.208
I stand up for our best players

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.500
’Specially against the twonks

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.708
who run this house these days

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:47.333
Well I’m here to return the favor

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.542
Now c’mon, we don’t have much time

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:49.083
Whaddya mean?

00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:49.917
Whaddya doin’?

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:50.917
We’re getting you out of here

00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:52.667
Wait...who’s “we”?

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:53.417
(Whistle)

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.958
Derrick! The key!

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.167
Toss it now!

00:00:56.542 --> 00:00:57.042
Huh?

00:00:57.292 --> 00:00:58.167
Joakim?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Where’s Derrick?

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:00.458
He had to go

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:01.667
He had family issues

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:02.667
What?

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.083
Well do you have the key?

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:05.333
Uh huh, yeah...

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:06.417
Well then toss it!

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:08.958
Right, right. Okay, sure

00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:16.917
Oh crap

00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:23.375
Men!

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:24.958
Do you hear that?

00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:27.125
It’s game time!

00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:28.542
YEAH!

00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:30.542
It’s early, for sure,

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.500
but if the season ended today,

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.333
we’d barely be in the eighth seed

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:38.667
Do you want to be in the eighth seed?

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:39.583
No!

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:40.292
Aye!

00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:43.250
No, Thad, we don’t want that

00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:46.625
Ayyyyyye DON’T want the eighth seed

00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:47.833
I don’t want that...

00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:51.333
We are the Pacers of Indiana!

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:53.833
We don’t settle for the eighth seed

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:54.458
No!

00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:58.542
Would Ser Reggie Miller have settled for the eighth seed?

00:01:58.542 --> 00:01:59.542
No!

00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:03.833
Would Jermaine of Neal have settled for the eighth seed?

00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:04.292
No!

00:02:04.292 --> 00:02:04.875
Probably not!

00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:05.583
Would...

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:09.458
M-Mark Jackson or...

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:14.208
Rik Smits have settled for the eighth seed?

00:02:14.208 --> 00:02:15.458
Maybe?

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.958
Who is Rip Smith?

00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:20.208
We are not an eighth seed team!

00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:21.208
Better than that!

00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.375
We will not be a seventh seed team!

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:24.375
Well, we probably will be though

00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:28.833
What I see, is MUCH better than our record

00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:30.333
I see a...

00:02:30.333 --> 00:02:33.125
fifth or sixth seed team!

00:02:33.417 --> 00:02:34.417
Probably seventh

00:02:34.417 --> 00:02:37.583
Who will at BEST make it to the second round

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:38.792
FIRST!
But probably no further!

00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:40.208
But probably no further!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:41.458
YEAH

00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:42.625
I’M OKAY WITH THAT!

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:43.542
Right now, 

00:02:43.542 --> 00:02:47.167
our defense is 25th in the league

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.292
Let's get that up to 15th!

00:02:49.292 --> 00:02:50.292
Yeah!

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:52.875
And our offense...it’s 20th!

00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:53.542
Boo!

00:02:53.542 --> 00:02:56.792
Let's inch that up to maybe also 15!

00:02:56.792 --> 00:02:57.833
15!

00:02:57.833 --> 00:02:59.458
So let’s go out there

00:02:59.667 --> 00:03:02.833
and send those Pistons back to Detroit

00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:05.417
and fulfill our destiny!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.583
To have a decent regular season

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:12.250
and a forgettable playoffs!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.625
YEAH!

